<theodulf. carm. 48.1>	Mox tamen imbelles petit inde profectio nostra
<theodulf. carm. 48.2>	Lemovices, populos omnes servire paratos.
<theodulf. carm. 48.3>	Horum opulenta fuit nobis urbs hospita, donec
<theodulf. carm. 48.4>	Usibus humanis novies sol astra fugaret,
<theodulf. carm. 48.5>	Auredusque expectanti se iungeret alae.
<theodulf. carm. 48.6>	Illic abbatum, cleri seu cetera turba
<theodulf. carm. 48.7>	Nos bene deliciis crebra bonitate refecit,
<theodulf. carm. 48.8>	Cum multo in nostros plebes madefacta Lyaeo
<theodulf. carm. 48.9>	Inruit, et nostri sese defendere certant.
<theodulf. carm. 48.10>	Impius antiquam gladius consumeret urbem,
<theodulf. carm. 48.11>	Me miserum, et nobis atrox iactura veniret,
<theodulf. carm. 48.12>	Ni foret Ephraim, seu Mancio presbyter iret,
<theodulf. carm. 48.13>	Quo prohibente furor cessavit mortis utrimque.
<theodulf. carm. 48.14>	Sagmatibus tandem his quae postulat usus onustis,
<theodulf. carm. 48.15>	Nos hinc digressos cepit Petricordia tellus.
<theodulf. carm. 48.16>	Inde tuas refluas petimus, Dordonia, ripas,
<theodulf. carm. 48.17>	Vix ubi deflexis elementi mole fluentis,
<theodulf. carm. 48.18>	Ulteriora iubis patuerunt littora equinis.
<theodulf. carm. 48.19>	Quos ter flumineis celeres iniecimus undis,
<theodulf. carm. 48.20>	Vocibus instantes, lapidum seu iactibus ipsis,
<theodulf. carm. 48.21>	Ter tamen invalidos fluviali pondere iactos,
<theodulf. carm. 48.22>	Per vada, per rupes, per saltus, perque cavernas,
<theodulf. carm. 48.23>	Sollicita invenit quaerentum turba trementes.
<theodulf. carm. 48.24>	Hos trepidare reor monstrum miserabile, littus
<theodulf. carm. 48.25>	Fecerat ulterius, terrasque pavere iacentes.
<theodulf. carm. 48.26>	Pallida namque fames nummorum forte redundans,
<theodulf. carm. 48.27>	Quae, Populana, tuas vastabat, Gallia, terras.
<theodulf. carm. 48.28>	Haec post, undivagos cymbis traiecimus amnes,
<theodulf. carm. 48.29>	Cornipedes udis trahimus nectendo capistris,
<theodulf. carm. 48.30>	Obvia sese ultro nostris adspectibus offert.
